.TH "GIT\-LFS\-LOCK" "1" "" "\ \&" "\ \&"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.nh
.ad l
.de URL
\fI\\$2\fP <\\$1>\\$3
..
